# Keystore signing secrets — never commit real keys
*.jks
*.keystore
# Release signing credentials: points at a .jks kept outside the repo, and holds
# its passwords. Losing this file and the key it names is unrecoverable, so back
# both up somewhere you will still have them.
keystore.properties

